# Pairs with NoLiveBucketAfterForget. Reproduces production before #4619 was
# fixed (#4638): a forwarded prepare that outlives its saga's terminal, the
# saga's completion and the retirement of its registry row reaches a
# destination leaf that has lost its memory of the terminal (a reactivation, or
# a fresh sibling); the registry reports the forgotten saga InFlight and the
# leaf buckets the prepare, which nothing will ever consume.
MODULE: NoLiveBucketAfterForgetLateForwardBucketed
TARGET: NoLiveBucketAfterForget
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a late forward of a forgotten saga is bucketed on a leaf that lost its memory of the terminal, stranded for good
PERTURBS: DeliverLate

--- FIND
    /\ IF term[spCopy][s2] \/ RegistryView # "inflight" \/ Gone(spCopy) \/ GuardRefuses
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no participant-row check; a forgotten saga reads as in flight.
    /\ IF term[spCopy][s2] \/ RegistryView # "inflight" \/ Gone(spCopy)
--- END